  "verdict": "Frozen 09:45 fixed-five-session center: 46.59% CAGR / 59.70% DD / 0.97 Sharpe at 1 bp; 37.39% / 61.65% / 0.86 at 5 bp; 26.71% / 64.40% / 0.71 at 10 bp.  The 1 bp result clears the bar and the 5 bp result clears the CAGR bar.  The signal-day placebo is significant (p=0.020 at 1 bp and 5 bp), but the hold-length plateau is jagged (N=2 11.5%, N=3 18.0%, N=4 16.6%, N=5 46.6%, N=6 28.7%) and the decision-time/threshold response has local spikes.  The lead's 43.65% 10:00 daily prototype is not reproducible causally: the 10:00->15:59 one-session version is 6.60% at 1 bp and -11.33% at 5 bp.  Treat this as a fragile dev pass, not a robust family winner.",
